### Bacon

**Source**: [Chow.com](http://www.chow.com/stories/11089)

**Notes**: 
- Use low heat for about 20 minutes.
- Cover the surface of the pan without overlapping the bacon slices.
- Flip frequently.
- When tiny white bubbles appear, it's almost done.

#### Ingredients:
- Bacon (amount as desired)

This method ensures the bacon is cooked evenly without burning. Enjoy your perfectly crisp bacon!
